{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":20,"code":"PRO","name":"Proverbs","testament":"OT"},"chapter":28,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PRO 28:1"},"The wicked flee when no man pursueth: but the righteous are bold as a lion. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:1"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PRO 28:2"},"For the transgression of a land many ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," the princes thereof: but by a man of understanding ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," knowledge the state ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["thereof "]},"shall be prolonged. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:2"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PRO 28:3"},"A poor man that oppresseth the poor ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is like"]}," a sweeping rain which leaveth no food. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:3"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PRO 28:4"},"They that forsake the law praise the wicked: but such as keep the law contend with them. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:4"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PRO 28:5"},"Evil men understand not judgment: but they that seek the LORD understand all ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["things. "]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:5"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PRO 28:6"},"Better ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," the poor that walketh in his uprightness, than ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["he that is"]}," perverse ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["in his"]}," ways, though he ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["be "]},"rich. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:6"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PRO 28:7"},"Whoso keepeth the law ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," a wise son: but he that is a companion of riotous ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["men"]}," shameth his father. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:7"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PRO 28:8"},"He that by usury and unjust gain increaseth his substance, he shall gather it for him that will pity the poor. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:8"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PRO 28:9"},"He that turneth away his ear from hearing the law, even his prayer ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["shall be"]}," abomination. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:9"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PRO 28:10"},"Whoso causeth the righteous to go astray in an evil way, he shall fall himself into his own pit: but the upright shall have good ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["things "]},"in possession. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:10"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PRO 28:11"},"The rich man ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," wise in his own conceit; but the poor that hath understanding searcheth him out. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:11"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PRO 28:12"},"When righteous ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["men"]}," do rejoice, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is"]}," great glory: but when the wicked rise, a man is hidden. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:12"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PRO 28:13"},"He that covereth his sins shall not prosper: but whoso confesseth and forsaketh ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["them"]}," shall have mercy. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:13"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PRO 28:14"},"Happy ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," the man that feareth alway: but he that hardeneth his heart shall fall into mischief. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:14"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PRO 28:15"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["As"]}," a roaring lion, and a ranging bear; ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["so is"]}," a wicked ruler over the poor people. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:15"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PRO 28:16"},"The prince that wanteth understanding ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," also a great oppressor: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["but"]}," he that hateth covetousness shall prolong ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his "]},"days. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:16"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PRO 28:17"},"A man that doeth violence to the blood of ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["any"]}," person shall flee to the pit; let no man stay him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:17"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PRO 28:18"},"Whoso walketh uprightly shall be saved: but ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["he that is"]}," perverse ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["in his"]}," ways shall fall at once. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:18"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PRO 28:19"},"He that tilleth his land shall have plenty of bread: but he that followeth after vain ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["persons"]}," shall have poverty enough. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:19"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PRO 28:20"},"A faithful man shall abound with blessings: but he that maketh haste to be rich shall not be innocent. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:20"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PRO 28:21"},"To have respect of persons ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," not good: for for a piece of bread ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," man will transgress. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:21"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PRO 28:22"},"He that hasteth to be rich ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["hath"]}," an evil eye, and considereth not that poverty shall come upon him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:22"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PRO 28:23"},"He that rebuketh a man afterwards shall find more favour than he that flattereth with the tongue. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:23"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"PRO 28:24"},"Whoso robbeth his father or his mother, and saith, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["It is "]},"no transgression; the same ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," the companion of a destroyer. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:24"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"25","sid":"PRO 28:25"},"He that is of a proud heart stirreth up strife: but he that putteth his trust in the LORD shall be made fat. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:25"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"26","sid":"PRO 28:26"},"He that trusteth in his own heart is a fool: but whoso walketh wisely, he shall be delivered. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:26"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"27","sid":"PRO 28:27"},"He that giveth unto the poor shall not lack: but he that hideth his eyes shall have many a curse. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:27"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"28","sid":"PRO 28:28"},"When the wicked rise, men hide themselves: but when they perish, the righteous increase. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 28:28"}]}]}
